Anyone directly hit by this grenade-like weapon will suffer 10[[d6]] points of [[fire damage]]. Everyone in the {{AoE|huge}} [[area of effect]] (including the original target) also suffers 1 point of [[fire damage]]. After exploding, an incendiary cloud is created at the targeted location that causes 4[[d6]] points of [[fire damage]] each [[round]] for 5 rounds to all creatures within the cloud's {{AoE|large}} area of effect.

==Notes==
* Introduced in the [[Hordes of the Underdark]] [[expansion pack]].
* The grenade will not affect friendly creatures nor neutral [[non-player character]]s who are not associates of [[player character]]s (the "standard" hostile targeting scheme).
* A ranged [[touch attack]] is performed to see if the fire bomb hits; damage is doubled on a [[critical hit]].

== Builder notes ==

* The lingering effect of this grenade uses the OnEnter, OnExit, and OnHeartbeat [[script]]s  of the ''[[incendiary cloud]]'' spell.

